Comment: 0,0:05:02.90,0:05:05.20,Overlap,,0000,0000,0000,,From that blast, there's no way it survived.{Line inserted, check time}
Comment: 0,0:16:54.53,0:16:56.99,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Confirming launch test.{Line inserted, check time}
Comment: 0,0:46:09.74,0:46:12.07,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Check this out! Awesome service!
Comment: 0,0:46:12.07,0:46:15.04,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We have hot young girls...
Comment: 0,0:46:15.04,0:46:16.70,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be right at the top!
Comment: 0,0:46:16.70,0:46:17.79,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Rest your tired body!
Comment: 0,0:46:17.79,0:46:18.54,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Recharge your energy!
Comment: 0,0:56:14.26,0:56:18.51,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Transferring Entry Plug Personal Data in all-range to Melchiore.{Line inserted, check time}
Comment: 0,0:56:17.85,0:56:18.43,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.{Line inserted, check time}
Comment: 0,0:56:18.43,0:56:18.81,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Sending data.{Line inserted, check time}
Comment: 0,0:56:18.81,0:56:19.85,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Melchiore confirmed.{Line inserted, check time}
Comment: 0,0:56:18.39,0:56:20.60,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Mental management numerical value achieved.{Line inserted, check time}
