Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.96,0:01:15.22,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It shows up now of all times?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:16.55,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.14,0:01:23.97,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Due to the current emergency situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.97,0:01:27.35,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,all phone lines have been suspended.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.35,0:01:28.15,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:30.48,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,My cellphone has no bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:32.61,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The buses and trains have all stopped too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.03,0:01:38.53,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess she won't be coming...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.87,0:01:40.91,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.91,0:01:42.45,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I should head to a shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.49,0:02:19.61,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Focus all fire on the target!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.63,0:02:40.13,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for the wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.90,0:02:57.99,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The target is still intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.99,0:03:00.90,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It is progressing toward Tokyo-3.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.90,0:03:03.24,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The Air Force is unable to damage it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.24,0:03:07.29,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Throw everything at it! Mobilize the Fourth Armored Division to intercept!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.29,0:03:08.75,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.75,0:03:10.58,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Destroy the target at all cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.35,0:03:33.48,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,How the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.48,0:03:35.61,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That was a direct hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.61,0:03:37.73,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The tank battalion was completely destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.73,0:03:40.61,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Missiles had no effect on it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.61,0:03:44.07,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's no use! We need more firepower!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.07,0:03:46.20,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,As we thought, there's an AT Field...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.20,0:03:46.83,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.83,0:03:49.66,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Conventional weapons are useless against the Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.21,0:03:54.46,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.46,0:03:56.21,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We will proceed as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.55,0:04:02.13,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.13,0:04:03.88,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,They're using an N² Mine?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.18,0:04:05.18,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.49,0:04:25.20,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.66,0:04:29.16,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm afraid we've left nothing for you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.82,0:04:29.66,Chatter,,0000,0000,0000,,Shockwave incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.54,0:04:31.87,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.87,0:04:32.79,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.79,0:04:35.04,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I just have some dirt in my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.04,0:04:36.89,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That's to be expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.89,0:04:37.25,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.08,0:04:39.67,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.67,0:04:41.59,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,And... push!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.05,0:04:50.28,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.28,0:04:51.46,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.46,0:04:54.18,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I should be thanking you, Katsuragi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.60,0:04:56.85,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You can call me Misato.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.85,0:04:59.77,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's nice to meet you, Ikari Shinji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.77,0:05:00.82,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.82,0:05:02.40,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What is the target's status?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:05.20,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Monitoring is not possible due to radio noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.20,0:05:07.30,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Restoring image.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.50,0:05:22.17,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Our final plan failed...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.17,0:05:24.59,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,How is this possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.59,0:05:26.17,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.97,0:05:30.72,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness Luno still moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.72,0:05:35.72,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It wouldn't be funny if my car was destroyed before I paid off my twelve month loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.72,0:05:38.23,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I have a direct express train there,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.23,0:05:40.48,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,so hopefully we'll get there in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.19,0:05:43.86,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,So... don't you have any questions, Shinji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.88,0:05:45.44,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.88,0:05:48.24,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I've been the only one talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.25,0:05:50.03,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.04,0:05:52.43,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.43,0:05:55.58,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Just... aren't you curious what that giant thing was?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.58,0:05:57.73,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Or maybe just what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.73,0:05:59.32,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.32,0:06:01.18,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.18,0:06:04.17,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I just thought I wouldn't get an answer either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.29,0:06:07.92,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You get too considerate and decide things on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.92,0:06:09.35,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You should act more like a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.41,0:06:13.62,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.62,0:06:15.76,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just doing as my teacher told.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.71,0:06:18.22,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.22,0:06:19.59,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.23,0:06:23.64,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, that thing back there was an unidentified life form known as an Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.76,0:06:31.20,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The fourth Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.68,0:06:34.51,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Its self-regenerating ability is quite impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.51,0:06:37.81,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a self-completing semi-perfect organism.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.81,0:06:38.66,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's no surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.08,0:06:42.13,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,An existence that ate the fruit of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.13,0:06:43.01,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.01,0:06:46.63,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,An existence that exists to annihilate those who ate the fruit of knowledge: us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.63,0:06:48.21,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The gate will be closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.21,0:06:49.72,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.68,0:06:53.47,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Secret military agency, Nerve?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.47,0:06:56.43,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it's a private organization under the direct supervision of the United Nations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.27,0:06:58.77,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's where my father is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.77,0:06:59.98,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.98,0:07:01.52,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know what he does?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.98,0:07:08.39,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,"Work of utmost importance for the protection of humanity."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.39,0:07:09.99,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That's what my teacher said.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.32,0:07:15.37,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,From this point on, you will be in command of this operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.37,0:07:17.45,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Show us your capabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.45,0:07:18.79,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.79,0:07:24.96,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ikari-kun, from our available weapons, we admit that we have no effective means of disabling the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.96,0:07:27.25,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you confident you can succeed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.09,0:07:30.09,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It is why Nerve exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.30,0:07:33.38,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Are we heading to where my father is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.22,0:07:34.97,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.97,0:07:35.89,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.89,0:07:41.02,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.10,0:07:46.56,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, were you given an I.D. by your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.69,0:07:48.82,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.07,0:07:51.24,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.65,0:07:52.36,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.86,0:07:56.20,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Here, read this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.91,0:07:58.16,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Nerve...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.24,0:08:01.33,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,My father's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.33,0:08:03.21,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Is there something I'm needed for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.33,0:08:06.88,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:11.38,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,He wouldn't send me a letter unless he needed me somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.38,0:08:12.88,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.88,0:08:14.84,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't get along with your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.68,0:08:17.18,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.35,0:08:23.98,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.64,0:08:26.44,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a real GeoFront!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.44,0:08:27.15,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.15,0:08:30.69,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,This is our secret base: Nerve Headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.48,0:08:35.49,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's the foundation for rebuilding our world and the last defense for humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.30,0:08:40.89,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.89,0:08:42.77,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Leave the West Entrance at the station...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.77,0:08:44.67,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,go right at North Gate-03...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.67,0:08:46.50,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,go into Route-08...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.30,0:08:52.42,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,This facility is structured like a maze for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.42,0:08:56.12,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I think this is the correct route...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.12,0:08:58.73,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, are we lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.73,0:09:00.30,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not used to this yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.30,0:09:03.35,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I'm sure we'll get there as long as we're moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.71,0:09:05.62,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Second phase cooling complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.62,0:09:07.22,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,All personnel return.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.53,0:09:11.71,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Finish defrosting the left arm's transmission in three minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.71,0:09:13.94,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,and do not forget to extract the apoptosis data.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.94,0:09:14.52,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.83,0:09:16.51,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Reporting to Dr. Akagi:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.51,0:09:21.66,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Lieutenant Colonel Katsuragi of the Strategic Department, and one other, have arrived in S-36.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.66,0:09:23.60,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.60,0:09:24.86,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You're late again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.25,0:09:31.50,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,A-Ah... Ritsuko!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.38,0:09:35.42,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You're twelve minutes over the estimated arrival time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.42,0:09:38.76,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I came to welcome you since you're so late, Lieutenant Colonel Katsuragi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.55,0:09:41.47,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't have the time or the manpower.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.47,0:09:42.60,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh... Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.43,0:09:48.31,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,This is the man's son?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.31,0:09:49.15,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.15,0:09:53.40,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm the Director of the First Science Division of Project E, Akagi Ritsuko.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.40,0:09:54.44,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.53,0:09:56.19,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.19,0:09:58.32,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, I'll leave the rest to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.66,0:10:04.74,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Meeting his son after 3 years...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.74,0:10:05.73,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Sub Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.73,0:10:08.14,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The target is beginning to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.14,0:10:09.27,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.27,0:10:11.22,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,All hands to level one battle stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.63,0:10:13.62,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I repeat:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.62,0:10:15.93,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,All hands to level one battle stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.93,0:10:18.30,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Prepare for anti-land ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.59,0:10:25.22,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ikari Shinij-kun, there's something I want to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.85,0:10:32.94,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,This is the ultimate humanoid fighting machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.94,0:10:34.96,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The artificial human, Evangelion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.96,0:10:35.94,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That is Unit-01.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.48,0:10:39.24,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It is our last and greatest weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.24,0:10:41.28,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,This is my father's work?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.28,0:10:42.49,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.20,0:10:45.33,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.79,0:10:48.37,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.25,0:10:53.08,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Prepare to sortie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.08,0:10:54.88,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Sortie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.88,0:10:57.38,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,But Unit-00 is still frozen!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.71,0:11:00.97,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Unless... you intend to use Unit-01?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.34,0:11:02.68,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,There is no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.39,0:11:05.85,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ikari Shinji-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.85,0:11:06.31,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.85,0:11:07.97,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You will pilot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.02,0:11:16.11,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you call me here, Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.52,0:11:18.94,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.94,0:11:22.57,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,So, you want me to pilot this and fight that thing outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.03,0:11:23.74,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.74,0:11:25.30,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.30,0:11:26.70,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Not after all this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.70,0:11:29.66,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,For so long I've thought you didn't care about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.66,0:11:32.37,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I called you because I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.67,0:11:36.59,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Father, why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.59,0:11:38.84,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Because it's impossible for any other human.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.34,0:11:41.76,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.76,0:11:43.38,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I've never seen or heard of this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.38,0:11:44.84,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.84,0:11:46.26,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You will be instructed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.26,0:11:48.81,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.81,0:11:51.10,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.10,0:11:52.94,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't pilot this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.94,0:11:55.15,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,If you're going to pilot it, do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.15,0:11:56.19,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Otherwise...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.19,0:11:57.27,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.08,0:12:10.45,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We've been found...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.87,0:12:14.98,Chatter,,0000,0000,0000,,Damage to layers 01 and 08.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.29,0:12:16.50,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun, there isn't much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.25,0:12:20.55,Chatter,,0000,0000,0000,,Conflagrations in Block-D. Closing all passages to the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.55,0:12:21.84,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Pilot it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.17,0:12:24.51,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.51,0:12:27.76,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,After coming all this way, this is ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.93,0:12:32.27,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun, why did you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.27,0:12:38.15,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't run away from your father, and above all, from yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.15,0:12:40.23,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.23,0:12:43.36,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,But, I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.95,0:12:50.66,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Fuyutsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.79,0:12:53.66,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Wake up Rei.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:55.12,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Can we use her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.12,0:12:57.12,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,She's not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.79,0:12:58.88,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.46,0:13:01.46,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Rei.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.46,0:13:02.38,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.38,0:13:04.07,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The spare is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.07,0:13:05.39,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You will do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.39,0:13:06.22,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.26,0:13:12.31,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Restart Unit-01's core unit to L-00 Type.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.31,0:13:13.35,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.35,0:13:16.44,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Discontinuing current process. Beginning reformat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:18.15,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Restarting the startup command.{Line inserted, check time}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.69,0:13:18.81,Overlap,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm useless again...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.90,0:13:21.90,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,as expected...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.90,0:13:24.27,Chatter,,0000,0000,0000,,The target has crossed the absolute line of defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.27,0:13:26.78,Chatter,,0000,0000,0000,,It is proceeding further in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.94,0:14:04.19,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.08,0:14:26.80,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I mustn’t run away, I mustn’t run away, I mustn’t run away, I mustn’t run away...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.92,0:14:28.80,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.26,0:14:30.55,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll pilot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.18,0:14:35.01,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Freezing process has been halted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.01,0:14:36.52,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Flywheel rotation has stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.52,0:14:37.81,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Connections have been released.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.81,0:14:39.18,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No problems with auxiliary voltage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.18,0:14:41.52,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Stoplight plug draining is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.52,0:14:44.44,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger, inserting Entry Plug.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.44,0:14:47.69,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Spinal conduction system opened, connection established.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.61,0:14:52.41,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Probe needle driving in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.41,0:14:54.46,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Prime synch established.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.27,0:14:55.82,Chatter,,0000,0000,0000,,Analyzing nerve connections.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.82,0:14:58.33,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Reading of -0.051% within limitations.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.33,0:15:00.83,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The plug has been fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.83,0:15:01.77,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.77,0:15:02.95,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Starting first contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.42,0:15:06.17,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Flooding Entry Plug.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.59,0:15:09.01,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.88,0:15:12.26,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:16.56,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Once the LCL fills your lungs, it will provide oxygen directly to your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.93,0:15:18.43,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.81,0:15:21.77,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Master power source connection complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.77,0:15:22.44,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.44,0:15:24.40,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Starting second contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.40,0:15:25.69,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Establishing interface.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.19,0:15:30.49,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No problems detected in A10 nervous system.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.49,0:15:32.95,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,LCL levels nominal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.95,0:15:36.62,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Japanese has been fixed as the primary mode of operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.62,0:15:39.12,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No problems detected with initial contacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.12,0:15:41.21,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Communication lines open.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.87,0:15:44.25,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Up to list 1405, all clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.25,0:15:47.80,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Synapse reading: Synchro rate 41.3%.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.25,0:15:49.99,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,And he's not even wearing a Plug Suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.99,0:15:51.13,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.13,0:15:53.43,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Harmonics are at normal levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.43,0:15:55.34,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Everything's under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.34,0:15:55.89,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,This will work!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.18,0:15:58.35,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Prepare to launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.35,0:16:00.31,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Prepare to launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.97,0:16:02.68,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Release primary lock bolts!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.23,0:16:05.56,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Primary locks released.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.56,0:16:07.94,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Releasing umbilical bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.53,0:16:11.11,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Release secondary lock bolts!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.57,0:16:15.74,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Removing primary restraints.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.74,0:16:17.91,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Removing secondary restraints.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.62,0:16:25.62,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Releasing safety devices one through fifteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.62,0:16:27.04,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Safety devices released.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.04,0:16:29.63,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Unit-01 is now free.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.63,0:16:31.46,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Internal power supply charge complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.46,0:16:33.38,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No problems detected with external power supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.38,0:16:34.84,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.84,0:16:36.76,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Evangelion Unit-01 transferring to launch pad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.76,0:16:39.58,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No problems with the linear rail track.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.58,0:16:42.02,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Electromagnetic guidance is in regular operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.02,0:16:45.77,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Unit-01 is currently moving through K-52.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.77,0:16:48.36,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Proceeding in accordance to the launch sequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.36,0:16:50.76,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Eva has reached the ejection sub terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.76,0:16:53.02,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Launch destination configured at ground level 0.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.99,0:16:59.32,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The course is clear. All green!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.32,0:17:01.74,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Launch preparations complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.74,0:17:02.49,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.45,0:17:04.96,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.96,0:17:06.21,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.21,0:17:09.54,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We must defeat the Angels, or we will all die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.17,0:17:13.42,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ikari, are you really okay with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.67,0:17:15.55,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.57,0:17:40.89,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,300)}Are you ready, Shinji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.70,0:17:42.24,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.24,0:17:44.37,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Release the final safety lock!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.29,0:17:48.25,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Evangelion Unit-01, lift off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.17,0:17:52.13,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.67,0:17:55.05,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,focus only on walking now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.67,0:17:56.88,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Walk...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.81,0:18:05.77,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It walked!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.14,0:18:09.98,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Walk...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.11,0:18:21.54,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.20,0:18:22.87,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.87,0:18:24.74,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Get up right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.05,0:18:37.67,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun, calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.67,0:18:39.72,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That isn't your arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.51,0:18:43.97,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,How is the Evangelion's defense system?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.97,0:18:45.35,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't get a signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.35,0:18:46.35,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The field isn't developing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.35,0:18:47.14,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No good?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.14,0:18:52.15,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The left arm has been fractured!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.15,0:18:52.85,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The circuits have snapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.65,0:18:56.73,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun, dodge it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.95,0:19:04.57,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The frontal cranium has been cracked!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.57,0:19:06.08,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The armor can't withstand much more!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.13,0:19:18.67,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Skull fractured! Damage unknown!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.67,0:19:20.38,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,A problem has occurred in the operating system!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.38,0:19:21.34,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Status report!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.34,0:19:22.82,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Synchro graph inverting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.82,0:19:24.00,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Pulse-flow is reversing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.01,0:19:25.09,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Cut the circuits!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.09,0:19:25.89,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.89,0:19:26.60,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's no good!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.60,0:19:28.72,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The signal is being rejected! It's not connecting!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.72,0:19:29.60,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What about Shinji-kun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.60,0:19:30.72,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No response from the monitoring system.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.72,0:19:31.60,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Life signs unknown!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.60,0:19:33.48,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Unit-01 is completely silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.48,0:19:34.31,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Misato!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.15,0:19:36.40,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's come to this...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.40,0:19:37.61,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Halt military operations!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.61,0:19:39.15,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The pilot's life is our main priority!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.15,0:19:40.69,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Eject the plug by force!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.69,0:19:41.70,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's no good!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.70,0:19:42.99,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not responding!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.99,0:19:44.32,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.75,0:19:53.12,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Eva has reactivated!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.12,0:19:53.92,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.92,0:19:55.38,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It shouldn't be able to move!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.75,0:19:56.96,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Has it gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.46,0:19:58.30,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,...berserk?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.73,0:20:19.69,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We've won.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.78,0:20:26.82,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,AT Field!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.62,0:20:29.74,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Unless the AT Field is breached...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.74,0:20:31.33,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,...you won't be able to do anything to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.21,0:20:39.54,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Left arm restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.54,0:20:40.13,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.92,0:20:46.09,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Unit-01 has also raised an AT Field!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.09,0:20:48.30,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Angel phase space being neutralized.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.30,0:20:50.43,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's corroding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.06,0:20:57.81,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It broke through that AT Field like it was nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.08,0:21:55.08,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Is Eva...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.26,0:22:09.34,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,This must be Eva's...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.05,0:22:11.26,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,...true form.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.98,0:22:21.23,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you decided on a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.23,0:22:23.15,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,If it's a boy, Shinji.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.15,0:22:25.40,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,If it's a girl, then Rei.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.40,0:22:27.03,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.03,0:22:27.86,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Rei...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.45,0:22:31.70,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.41,0:22:33.83,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.49,0:22:36.41,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.41,0:22:37.75,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.58,0:22:39.62,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Rei...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.42,0:22:42.13,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Rei...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.13,0:22:43.25,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ikari...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.92,0:22:44.84,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Rei...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.59,0:22:46.80,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not right...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.51,0:22:49.01,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.01,0:22:50.05,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Rei!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.82,0:23:13.28,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know this ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.16,0:23:23.67,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The attack of the fourth Angel, and its defeat...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.17,0:23:27.00,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Then the discovery of the Third Child
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.00,0:23:28.92,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,and the activation of Eva Unit-01.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.55,0:23:31.38,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,All of this was predetermined.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.38,0:23:35.68,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Repairing Unit-01 is a large unexpected cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.68,0:23:39.64,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That is hardly a problem compared to a frozen Unit-00.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.02,0:23:43.10,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Eva Unit-01's recovery operation is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.10,0:23:45.73,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It is currently locked in Cage Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.73,0:23:48.48,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,A ten day examination is scheduled.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.48,0:23:50.15,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,And the recording from when it went berserk?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.15,0:23:53.66,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It was functioning at zero capacity. Nothing was recorded.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.66,0:23:56.45,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Reason unknown, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.45,0:23:58.12,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Trusting it as an effective weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.12,0:24:00.50,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,might be a little difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.50,0:24:05.42,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Inconveniences aside, Unit-01 needs to perform at least until the fifth Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.42,0:24:06.96,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.96,0:24:09.30,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Unit-01 is not our only weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.30,0:24:13.62,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Unit-02's pilot is currently being evaluated in Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.62,0:24:16.76,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The construction of Unit-03 is also progressing as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.76,0:24:20.65,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Your primary duty is to oversee Nerve and Eva with discretion.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.65,0:24:23.10,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We will not stand for any repeated disappointments.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.10,0:24:24.06,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.06,0:24:27.73,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,To exterminate the Angels is but one step in fulfilling our contract with Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.73,0:24:29.69,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The Human Instrumentality Project...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.69,0:24:33.61,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,This should be your top priority, understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.61,0:24:34.90,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.90,0:24:38.07,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Everything will go according to Seele's scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.47,0:25:07.77,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The complete collapse of the Angel's AT Field was far beyond our expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.77,0:25:10.24,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The blood is like a lake from hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.24,0:25:12.32,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It reminds me of the Second Impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.32,0:25:13.74,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It makes me sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.74,0:25:15.61,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Eva can defeat the Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.61,0:25:19.53,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That fact alone is enough of a hope for humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.53,0:25:22.83,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's the pilot who carries the burden of that hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.82,0:26:01.66,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.66,0:26:02.78,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.78,0:26:06.66,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,His room's in Block Six. I assume that isn't a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.66,0:26:07.71,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.71,0:26:08.79,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that really okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.79,0:26:10.12,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.12,0:26:12.08,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay, I prefer being alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.75,0:26:14.55,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's always the same wherever I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.13,0:26:16.05,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.05,0:26:21.18,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Like I was saying, Shinji-kun would be much better off at my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.18,0:26:23.05,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, I have authorization.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.05,0:26:26.68,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, it's not like I'll have my hands all over him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.10,0:26:27.52,Overlap,,0000,0000,0000,,That goes without saying!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.52,0:26:30.23,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you no shame?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.23,0:26:32.36,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,She really can't take a joke...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.52,0:26:38.57,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, looks like we're having a party tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.57,0:26:39.61,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.61,0:26:43.28,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,To welcome my new roommate of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.24,0:26:48.08,M2,OTHERS,0000,0000,0000,,So you're going to move after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.08,0:26:48.96,M2,OTHERS,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.96,0:26:53.29,M2,OTHERS,0000,0000,0000,,I never thought this city would become a battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.29,0:26:58.46,M2,OTHERS,0000,0000,0000,,Really! My husband said we should evacuate soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.46,0:27:02.59,M2,OTHERS,0000,0000,0000,,Just today, over one hundred people left the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.59,0:27:04.26,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.26,0:27:08.85,M2,OTHERS,0000,0000,0000,,No matter how powerful a fortress this city is, those Nerve people still don't know what they're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.85,0:27:12.40,M2,OTHERS,0000,0000,0000,,Just thinking about yesterday makes me shudder...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.40,0:27:14.02,M2,OTHERS,0000,0000,0000,,I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.40,0:27:18.48,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.48,0:27:21.32,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,but we'll be making a quick stop on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.32,0:27:22.32,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.32,0:27:24.66,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,A really cool place.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.87,0:27:32.16,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The city...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.62,0:27:34.21,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It seems so lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.04,0:27:37.04,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.75,0:28:12.58,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.58,0:28:15.25,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The buildings are growing!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.93,0:28:36.35,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,This is our stronghold against the onslaught of Angels,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.90,0:28:39.48,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Tokyo-3.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.48,0:28:40.78,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,This is our home...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.24,0:28:46.99,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,and the city you protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.08,0:28:56.33,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I think your things have already been delivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.33,0:29:00.92,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,To be honest, I've only moved here recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.92,0:29:03.13,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.13,0:29:05.47,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.47,0:29:06.80,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Pardon the intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.51,0:29:11.35,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun, this is your home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.60,0:29:19.61,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.15,0:29:21.44,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.65,0:29:25.07,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.07,0:29:27.36,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a little messy in here. Don't mind it though.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.41,0:29:30.53,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,A little...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.91,0:29:32.03,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,messy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.03,0:29:35.37,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh sorry, could you put the food in the fridge please?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.37,0:29:37.04,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.21,0:29:38.83,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ice...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.79,0:29:40.71,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Junk food...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.79,0:29:43.13,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,And nothing but beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.00,0:29:46.01,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of life does she lead?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.26,0:29:49.26,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.26,0:29:50.22,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.02,0:30:03.73,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I love it! I live for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.82,0:30:06.07,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Not hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.07,0:30:09.32,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's pretty good for instant food.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.32,0:30:13.08,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, well... I'm just not used to this sort of meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.08,0:30:14.45,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.70,0:30:15.87,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't be so picky!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.62,0:30:18.87,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's not it...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.87,0:30:20.50,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.04,0:30:22.17,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Pretty fun, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.34,0:30:25.46,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Having a meal with another person?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.09,0:30:28.38,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.38,0:30:29.55,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.55,0:30:31.76,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Since this is your home now,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.22,0:30:34.39,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,you have to act like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.97,0:30:36.35,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.35,0:30:37.19,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.19,0:30:40.30,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,"Yes, yes, yes, yes." Don't be so boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.30,0:30:41.81,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You're a boy, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.81,0:30:43.90,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Pull yourself together!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.77,0:30:45.98,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.98,0:30:47.15,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.15,0:30:52.03,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Go take a bath and wash away all that negativity.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.03,0:30:54.16,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Bathing is the laundry of life!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.29,0:31:05.21,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,M-M-Misato-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.79,0:31:06.50,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.18,0:31:12.72,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, him?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.72,0:31:15.35,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,He's my hot-weather penguin friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.73,0:31:25.81,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,A bird like that exists?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.81,0:31:27.32,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,They did 15 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.32,0:31:28.65,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,There were so many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.65,0:31:30.28,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,His name is Pen-Pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.28,0:31:34.57,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,He'll be your other roommate in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.57,0:31:37.08,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway... shouldn't you be hiding that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.87,0:31:46.38,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,A little obvious, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.38,0:31:48.42,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe I'm the one who'll be seen through...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.17,0:31:51.80,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Katsuragi Misato-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.55,0:31:55.64,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,She's not a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.64,0:31:57.43,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Bathing is the laundry of life!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.14,0:32:02.27,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,More bad memories come up in here than others.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.89,0:32:05.69,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What is Rei's current state?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.65,0:32:10.44,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you go to the hospital at noon?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.61,0:32:12.61,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,There are no problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.61,0:32:16.49,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Preparations to restart the frozen Unit-00 come first.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.49,0:32:18.45,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Is your son's current condition acceptable?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.45,0:32:20.99,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,His mental state must be very unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.99,0:32:22.73,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,He's been released.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.73,0:32:26.42,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Still, his condition is a good excuse to cancel the freezing of Unit-00.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.42,0:32:29.42,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes... It was Lieutenant Colonel Katsuragi's proposal after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.93,0:32:48.65,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Even without a preliminary report, they suddenly elected him the Third Child.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.65,0:32:51.98,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,And as if in response, the fourth Angel attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.98,0:32:56.57,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,In addition, Commander Ikari forces his son to pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.57,0:32:59.32,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,There must be some resentment.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.32,0:33:00.45,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,But still,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.45,0:33:04.50,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,knowing the Angel has been defeated, I feel surprisingly...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.16,0:33:06.54,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.84,0:33:11.71,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Another ceiling I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.88,0:33:14.59,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That's no surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.59,0:33:17.93,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Because I don't know anything of this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.93,0:33:20.01,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,This is your home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.47,0:33:23.35,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Why am I here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.86,0:33:40.28,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun? I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.74,0:33:46.29,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I forgot to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.29,0:33:49.58,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You did a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.00,0:33:51.63,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You should be proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.63,0:33:53.59,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Goodnight, Shinji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.50,0:33:55.67,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.89,0:34:04.89,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, exchange student.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.89,0:34:07.06,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I have to hit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.06,0:34:08.77,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I just won't be satisfied if I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.90,0:34:11.27,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Real sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.27,0:34:15.42,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That guy's little sister was injured in that big incident the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.42,0:34:17.28,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.82,0:34:21.95,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like I piloted it because I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.26,0:34:44.26,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What part of this is being praised?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.89,0:34:48.73,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,If it was such a good thing to pilot Eva, why am I getting hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.73,0:34:55.11,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you ready, Shinji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.11,0:34:56.19,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.19,0:34:59.49,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Within an Angel is a central core.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.40,0:35:05.16,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Destroying it is the only way to kill an Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.62,0:35:10.12,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Therefore, always aim for the center, and pull the switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.75,0:35:15.21,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We will work on accuracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.21,0:35:16.88,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You will remember the sensation when the time comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.88,0:35:17.38,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.26,0:35:24.09,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.09,0:35:26.93,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We will continue practice in Induction Mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.93,0:35:27.76,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.15,0:35:37.77,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun sure has brought himself around to piloting Eva, hasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.77,0:35:40.11,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,He does whatever people tell him to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.11,0:35:42.61,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's how he gets through life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.28,0:35:47.45,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Position the target in the center... pull the switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.24,0:35:51.75,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Position the target in the center... pull the switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.75,0:35:54.88,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Position the target in the center... pull the switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.88,0:35:57.29,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Position the target in the center... pull the switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.75,0:36:01.34,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That reminds me...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.34,0:36:04.43,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun was hit by a student at his new school.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.43,0:36:06.93,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Is his security detail working all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.93,0:36:09.99,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no problem with the secret agency's surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.99,0:36:11.89,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, it wasn't very bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.89,0:36:15.94,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It was better for there to be no outside interference.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.94,0:36:17.69,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Doesn't he live with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.69,0:36:20.23,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,His care is your responsibility too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.23,0:36:22.28,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's for that reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.28,0:36:25.07,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's difficult... He's just too naive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.07,0:36:26.82,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that a complaint?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.82,0:36:29.62,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You were the one who was so adamant about taking him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.62,0:36:31.08,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.83,0:36:37.42,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.42,0:36:43.09,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, he doesn't have much of a personality for making friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.76,0:36:45.88,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you heard of the "Hedgehog's dilemma"?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.88,0:36:47.14,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Hedgehog?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.14,0:36:49.10,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The little prickly things?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.10,0:36:53.52,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,If a hedgehog wants to be close with other hedgehogs...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.52,0:36:58.65,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,the closer they become, the more they hurt each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.65,0:37:01.48,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,People are the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.48,0:37:02.94,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The same is true of Shinji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.94,0:37:05.28,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Within his heart he remembers the pain of being hurt,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.28,0:37:07.41,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,so he cowers away.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.41,0:37:14.79,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, eventually he'll realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.66,0:37:18.04,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Growing up means
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.04,0:37:20.84,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,being hurt whether you're close with others,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.84,0:37:26.13,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,or if they're kept at a distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.13,0:37:27.76,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I suppose you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.05,0:37:33.93,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Still, when will we get the B-Section equipment repair estimate?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.93,0:37:37.23,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Eva's maintenance and battle capacity is their main priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.23,0:37:39.47,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,They probably don't have money for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.47,0:37:41.40,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,My butt is freezing...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.37,0:37:52.58,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,An emergency call...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.58,0:37:54.29,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.76,0:38:10.64,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The object has been visually identified.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.64,0:38:12.68,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,E747 has also confirmed the object.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.68,0:38:13.85,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Analysis indicates Pattern Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.22,0:38:16.18,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no doubt that it's the fifth Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.56,0:38:18.56,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,All hands to level one battle stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.56,0:38:19.35,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.35,0:38:21.31,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Preparing anti-aircraft measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.31,0:38:24.07,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Tokyo-3 transforming to battle formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.48,0:38:28.57,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Initiating Central Block.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.25,0:39:25.63,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Districts One through Seven of Central Block transferred.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.63,0:39:28.25,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Notification to all government ministries completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.25,0:39:29.96,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Target is steadily progressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.96,0:39:33.22,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,All anti-aircraft systems currently functioning at 48%.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.22,0:39:35.93,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What is the status of civilians and noncombatants?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.93,0:39:38.64,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Reports confirm that they have already been evacuated to shelters.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.39,0:39:41.27,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,All Elementary and Middle School student classes,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.27,0:39:44.90,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,please gather in your designated blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.90,0:39:50.25,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,There is a lost child at shelter number 323 in Sector Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.19,0:39:48.07,Overlap,,0000,0000,0000,,At it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.07,0:39:50.49,Overlap,,0000,0000,0000,,There's only letters on the screen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.49,0:39:52.61,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's an information blackout.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.61,0:39:55.11,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,They won't show us regular citizens anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.11,0:39:57.41,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,even if this is a big event.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.79,0:40:07.25,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,They're just wasting tax money...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.25,0:40:11.05,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Some people in this world {\i1}need{\i0} those bullets to be used.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.76,0:40:14.76,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The Japanese government is demanding we send out an Evangelion.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.76,0:40:16.09,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,How annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.09,0:40:18.26,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like we weren't going to anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.64,0:40:20.68,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Starting Entry Plug.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.68,0:40:21.99,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,LCL levels nominal...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.99,0:40:23.43,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Crimp lock released.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.43,0:40:25.31,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Father isn't even here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.31,0:40:26.85,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Why am I piloting this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.02,0:40:29.86,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Even though I got beat up...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.11,0:40:36.49,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, I wanna talk to you about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.49,0:40:37.57,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What about?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.57,0:40:39.53,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.53,0:40:40.66,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.66,0:40:43.41,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah! That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.95,0:40:43.29,Overlap,,0000,0000,0000,,Class Rep!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.41,0:40:44.08,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.08,0:40:46.33,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We both have to go to the john apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.33,0:40:49.04,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, you had your chance earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.71,0:40:51.13,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,So, what's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.13,0:40:54.05,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Before I die, I'm going to see at least one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.05,0:40:55.26,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That battle up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.26,0:40:56.80,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's the real thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.80,0:41:00.14,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Who knows when the next enemy will come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.14,0:41:02.68,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Kensuke, you're nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.68,0:41:05.56,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,If I miss this chance, I might never get another!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.56,0:41:09.01,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on... Just help me open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.01,0:41:10.31,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Guess I've got no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.31,0:41:13.86,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You sure don't give in, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.57,0:41:18.75,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun, are you ready to sortie?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.75,0:41:19.57,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.57,0:41:20.91,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.91,0:41:24.70,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Neutralize the enemy's AT Field, then rapidly fire with the gatling gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.70,0:41:26.91,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Just like in practice. You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.91,0:41:27.71,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.71,0:41:28.54,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.35,0:41:44.64,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.64,0:41:47.35,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,This was worth the trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.35,0:41:48.35,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Just in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.90,0:41:55.82,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.11,0:42:00.24,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Position the target in the center... pull the switch...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.11,0:42:00.24,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,AT Field is developing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.24,0:42:02.53,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Position target in the center... pull the switch...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.24,0:42:01.16,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Just as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.16,0:42:02.53,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you ready, Shinji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.53,0:42:03.53,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.38,0:42:12.04,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.04,0:42:13.50,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The smoke is concealing the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.18,0:42:30.27,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like it got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.27,0:42:31.27,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,He'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.27,0:42:32.52,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We're sending up a reserve rifle!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.19,0:42:34.73,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.15,0:42:37.40,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun...?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.40,0:42:38.74,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.74,0:42:40.45,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh man...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.45,0:42:43.12,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,He must still be messed up from when you hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.12,0:42:44.33,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Sh-Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.35,0:43:05.76,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Umbilical Cable has been disconnected!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.76,0:43:07.72,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Eva switching to internal power!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.72,0:43:10.52,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Active time remaining is 4 minutes 53 seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.52,0:43:16.77,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.40,0:43:23.25,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.25,0:43:24.32,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.32,0:43:25.07,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Can he hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.07,0:43:25.95,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No problems detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.95,0:43:27.12,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It should run!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.50,0:43:38.25,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun's classmates?!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.25,0:43:39.55,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What are they doing there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.06,0:43:50.09,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Why won't he fight it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.09,0:43:53.44,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,He can't move because we're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.44,0:43:57.11,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Unit-01 will reach active time limit in 3 minutes 28 seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.11,0:43:59.94,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Contact with outer surface, damage at 58%!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.95,0:44:07.58,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun, let those two into the cockpit!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.58,0:44:09.83,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Retreat once they're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.83,0:44:10.75,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll regroup later.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.12,0:44:15.79,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You two, get in quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.92,0:44:20.46,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What? There's water!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.07,0:44:21.82,Chatter,,0000,0000,0000,,My camera!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.00,0:44:20.46,Overlap,,0000,0000,0000,,LCL levels nominal.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.46,0:44:22.30,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Entry Plug restarting.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.97,0:44:28.93,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Penetrating through third protection film!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.94,0:44:38.44,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Now! Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.94,0:44:44.57,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Take recovery Route 34.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.57,0:44:46.70,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Head to the mountain's eastern side!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.15,0:44:47.53,Overlap,,0000,0000,0000,,Exchange student, she said "retreat!"
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.99,0:44:49.70,Overlap,,0000,0000,0000,,Exchange student!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.53,0:44:50.41,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I mustn’t run away...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.41,0:44:51.45,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I mustn’t run away...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.12,0:44:56.50,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Progressive Knife equipped!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.58,0:45:00.63,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.63,0:45:01.42,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Fall back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.42,0:45:02.25,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.59,0:45:08.89,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.99,0:45:31.03,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Unit-01 will reach active time limit in 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.41,0:45:34.37,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,28, 27, 26...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.37,0:45:38.33,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,25, 24, 23, 22...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.88,0:45:46.80,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,13, 12, 11, 10, 9...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.80,0:45:50.84,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,8, 7, 6, 5...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.84,0:45:54.72,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,4, 3, 2, 1...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.27,0:46:05.57,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Eva Unit-01 has ceased all activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.57,0:46:08.53,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The target has completely collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.65,0:46:49.82,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you ignore my orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.57,0:46:51.82,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.24,0:46:54.66,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm the one responsible for this military operation, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.66,0:46:55.95,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.95,0:46:59.20,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,When I give you an order, it is your duty to follow them.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.20,0:47:00.91,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.91,0:47:01.62,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.12,0:47:04.08,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Make this the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.71,0:47:05.59,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.59,0:47:08.63,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you really understand what I'm telling you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.63,0:47:09.88,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.88,0:47:12.01,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I understand, Misato-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.09,0:47:15.43,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine since we won, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.22,0:47:19.18,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,If you tell me to pilot Eva, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.24,0:47:33.70,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.70,0:47:35.99,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Go back and get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.31,0:48:01.77,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The next station is Naga'o Toge.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.64,0:48:04.73,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Please exit to the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.06,0:48:51.36,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,He has no intention of coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.36,0:48:52.11,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.87,0:49:44.04,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ikari, Ikari Shinji.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.54,0:49:45.66,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.66,0:49:48.17,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Absent so soon after transferring...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.17,0:49:52.25,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Well regardless, I'll hand back yesterday's test.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.42,0:50:34.09,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.21,0:50:38.09,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Take me back to Misato-san's place!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.49,0:51:02.78,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Did walking around for days cheer you up, Ikari Shinji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.88,0:51:08.23,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.23,0:51:11.10,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't matter what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.67,0:51:13.92,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not free to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.67,0:51:18.92,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I have to pilot the Eva regardless.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.92,0:51:21.42,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's the only reason my father called me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.38,0:51:23.89,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.89,0:51:24.97,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll pilot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.97,0:51:28.06,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,If that's what everyone wants, that's what I'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.06,0:51:29.93,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What everyone wants?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.93,0:51:31.31,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.31,0:51:34.48,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I know I can't do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.48,0:51:36.82,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.82,0:51:39.99,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Father, Misato-san, even an injured Ayanami{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.99,0:51:41.19,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.19,0:51:43.48,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,This has nothing to do with anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.48,0:51:47.84,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You decide whether you continue to pilot Eva.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.84,0:51:49.76,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,If you want to leave this terrible place, fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.76,0:51:51.76,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's all up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.76,0:51:53.25,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Do as you please!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.84,0:52:02.59,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,In the end, your son acted as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.59,0:52:03.72,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.72,0:52:06.55,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Next we will have Rei move in closer to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.01,0:52:09.64,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The plan has not changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.64,0:52:12.02,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,A 14 year old scenario...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.02,0:52:15.31,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Our fate rests on children.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.98,0:52:17.94,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it a bit cruel?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.70,0:52:25.61,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No holding back.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.99,0:52:27.41,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Go ahead and hit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.78,0:52:30.37,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't feel satisfied if you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.37,0:52:34.08,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, seeing as he's so sincere, I'd go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.96,0:52:42.92,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Now we're even.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.92,0:52:45.18,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Im sorry for hitting you, Ikari.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.06,0:53:00.23,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Go for it, Tayoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.23,0:53:02.11,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,If you lose, you're paying for pizza!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.11,0:53:03.25,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.25,0:53:04.07,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.07,0:53:05.76,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Please, make me go one more{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.76,0:53:07.99,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, they're looking over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.99,0:53:08.72,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Pervs!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.72,0:53:09.86,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.86,0:53:11.74,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Suzuhara has a weird look in his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.74,0:53:14.00,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ikari-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.21,0:53:17.96,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami Rei, age 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.58,0:53:22.95,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,She was the first candidate chosen by the Marduk Report.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.95,0:53:24.53,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The First Child.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.53,0:53:29.18,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Specifically, she is the exclusive pilot of the experimental Evangelion Unit-00.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.18,0:53:31.05,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Her personal history is non-existent.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.05,0:53:33.18,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Everything has been erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.18,0:53:36.64,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did my father rescue her?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.64,0:53:38.81,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Start-up system corrupt!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.81,0:53:40.56,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Problem detected in Stage 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.56,0:53:43.82,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Nervous system elements rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.90,0:53:46.07,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Pulse-flow is reversing!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.07,0:53:47.53,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Unable to stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.53,0:53:49.66,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Direct monitoring disrupted.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.66,0:53:50.87,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Entry Plug in unstable depths.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.87,0:53:52.66,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Eva is refusing to release it!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.66,0:53:53.87,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Halt all contacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.87,0:53:55.87,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Break circuits 1 through 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.87,0:53:58.54,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's no good, the signal isn't connecting!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.75,0:54:01.58,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Eva Unit-00 is out of control!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.58,0:54:02.79,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop the experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.79,0:54:03.88,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Cut all power.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.88,0:54:04.42,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.72,0:54:12.93,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Unit-00 is currently on reserve power.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.93,0:54:15.22,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Complete shutdown in 35 seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.22,0:54:17.27,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Suspension in process.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.73,0:54:25.19,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's dangerous! Step back!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.36,0:54:29.20,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Auto-ejection system engaging!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.20,0:54:29.78,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.70,0:54:38.08,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Quickly, release the bakelite!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.62,0:54:40.25,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Rei!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.79,0:54:46.67,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Complete shutdown in 10 seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.67,0:54:50.72,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,8, 7, 6, 5...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.72,0:54:54.64,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,4, 3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.76,0:54:58.81,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Unit-00 has ceased all activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.57,0:55:14.70,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Rei, are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.28,0:55:16.49,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Rei!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.96,0:55:22.04,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.59,0:55:29.96,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's rather unbelievable, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.96,0:55:34.05,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Despite the official report having been destroyed, it's all true.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.05,0:55:38.06,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,To unfreeze Unit-00 after it just went berserk...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.06,0:55:39.39,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that a bit hasty?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.39,0:55:41.55,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Another Angel suddenly appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.55,0:55:44.23,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Our combat readiness is an urgent priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.23,0:55:46.61,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I suppose that's true...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.61,0:55:49.53,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Rei's restart test has already been authorized.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.53,0:55:51.61,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Using Unit-00 won't be a problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.99,0:55:55.66,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,providing we repair a few more nerve connections...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.66,0:55:58.99,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Immediate re-deployment, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.08,0:56:04.62,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.62,0:56:07.29,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Why is she always alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.29,0:56:09.72,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Evangelion Unit-01 is now in Cooling Phase 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.72,0:56:12.76,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No abnormalities in synchronization from the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.11,0:56:14.03,Chatter,,0000,0000,0000,,Please complete all system checks in Cage 6 up to phase 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.76,0:56:14.83,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Desired number achieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.83,0:56:15.74,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.74,0:56:18.04,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Transferring results to Valta.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.82,0:56:36.69,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.69,0:56:40.32,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Synchro Test, Program 508 complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.32,0:56:41.74,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun, good job today.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.08,0:56:44.83,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.83,0:56:46.58,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,how's living together with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.58,0:56:47.41,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,So-so.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.41,0:56:48.33,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll take some getting used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.33,0:56:50.00,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Is there any leftover tension?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.00,0:56:53.25,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not your first time living with a man, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.30,0:56:56.67,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't like eight years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.67,0:56:58.67,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,"Love" isn't involved this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.67,0:56:59.97,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.97,0:57:03.64,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I think Shinji-kun stayed because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.64,0:57:04.85,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.64,0:57:07.90,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I think... he stayed because of his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.73,0:57:13.40,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,He wants his father to see, touch, and know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.40,0:57:16.11,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Even just one word of praise.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.65,0:57:19.74,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,He wants affection that'll stop him from feeling lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.16,0:57:24.66,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,He's a very distant man... like your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.83,0:57:31.42,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder why he pays so little attention to him...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.42,0:57:33.54,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,He seems to speak only to Rei.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.54,0:57:34.88,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a terrible balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.88,0:57:38.89,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Men nowadays are only interested in themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.89,0:57:42.22,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not a very good time for women.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.68,0:57:44.93,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.23,0:57:48.60,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's time we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.60,0:57:51.44,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,A worker bee as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.44,0:57:56.19,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Misato, here's Shinji-kun's official security card
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.19,0:57:58.15,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,and Ayanami Rei's renewed card.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.15,0:58:00.24,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,They were delivered some time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.24,0:58:02.12,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Would you give them both to Shinji-kun tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.45,0:58:05.79,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.58,0:58:09.75,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami Rei...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.38,0:58:17.47,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Why was my father laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.92,0:58:20.93,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Why doesn't he laugh with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.79,0:58:53.08,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.33,0:58:59.09,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me, it's Ikari!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.63,0:59:02.51,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami, I'm coming in!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.54,0:59:39.76,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Are these Ayanami's?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.02,0:59:55.60,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.44,1:00:00.40,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't trying to{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.06,1:00:33.93,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Could you move?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.27,1:00:39.81,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.20,1:00:58.00,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.21,1:01:03.19,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.21,1:01:09.97,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I was supposed to...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.05,1:01:15.27,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,T-The card! The card was renewed and...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.93,1:01:17.85,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,t-that's why I...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.23,1:01:21.35,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.35,1:01:24.11,M2,,0000,0000,0000,, I wasn't trying to...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.65,1:01:33.98,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ritsuko-san gave it to me because she forgot...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.98,1:01:35.00,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.00,1:01:39.87,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No one answered when I rang, and the door wasn't locked...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.76,1:01:54.85,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Central Dogma is currently open.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.85,1:01:58.47,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Please use Direct Gate 4 in Group 3.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.86,1:02:04.48,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Here's your new card.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.48,1:02:06.40,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ritsuko-san left it with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.03,1:02:15.99,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for what I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.99,1:02:17.16,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.62,1:02:25.05,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, aren't you afraid, Ayanami?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.05,1:02:27.75,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Getting into that Evangelion again...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.38,1:02:29.84,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.80,1:02:34.18,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I heard you got hurt in that test...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.18,1:02:37.30,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going to be okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.18,1:02:40.47,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.47,1:02:41.81,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.81,1:02:43.06,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.06,1:02:46.42,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,aren't you afraid it will go berserk again?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.42,1:02:50.45,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,If we lose to the Angels, we'll all die...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.57,1:02:53.95,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You're Commander Ikari's son, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.20,1:02:58.70,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't trust your father's work?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.33,1:03:00.62,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.62,1:03:01.71,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,He's not much of a father...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.03,1:03:31.19,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The observed target has cleared Odawara defense line.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.19,1:03:33.24,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Unidentified object analysis complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.24,1:03:35.32,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Pattern blue. Angel confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.32,1:03:37.91,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,As we thought, it's the sixth Angel.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.91,1:03:39.87,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.87,1:03:41.83,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Prepare to sortie Unit-01.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.83,1:03:44.96,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Evangelion Unit-01, prepare to launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.96,1:03:46.88,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Moving to Cage 1 runway.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.38,1:03:51.71,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The target has cleared Lake Ashinoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.71,1:03:53.72,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Evangelion Unit-01 is ready to launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.72,1:03:54.55,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Launch!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.68,1:04:05.73,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,High energy reaction detected inside the target!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.73,1:04:06.52,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.65,1:04:07.27,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.40,1:04:11.11,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.67,1:04:32.46,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Drop the synchro rate to 0%.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.46,1:04:33.63,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Raise protective armor!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.90,1:04:57.03,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Suspend attack!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.03,1:04:58.70,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Recover Eva Unit-01 immediately!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.70,1:04:59.28,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's no good!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.28,1:05:01.28,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The catapult is melting... It's unusable!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.28,1:05:02.41,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What about the AT Field?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.41,1:05:03.70,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It is expanded to the limit.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.70,1:05:05.96,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It is barely maintaining!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.17,1:05:11.59,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.25,1:05:13.42,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I can't!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.42,1:05:14.80,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.80,1:05:16.47,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me out, Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.47,1:05:17.70,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We're breaking military protocol!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.70,1:05:19.02,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The pilot's life is our main priority!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.02,1:05:20.68,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Force eject the plug!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.68,1:05:21.81,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.18,1:05:27.81,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,If the pilot is taken out, the AT Field will completely collapse.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.31,1:05:30.40,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I know this is extremely hard to bear.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.31,1:05:32.11,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.94,1:05:40.78,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Enough of this...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.86,1:05:43.24,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Force recover the fuselage!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.24,1:05:44.70,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ignite the blasting bolts!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.35,1:06:08.47,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The target has ceased fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.47,1:06:09.64,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Recover Unit-01.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.64,1:06:10.68,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Sending to Cage 99!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.68,1:06:11.81,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Put the rescue squad on standby!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.81,1:06:14.11,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Plug LCL coolant at its highest level.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.11,1:06:16.11,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Pilot confirmed. Heartbeat is very weak!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.11,1:06:18.28,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Set plug suit life support to maximum.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.28,1:06:19.44,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Begin heart massage!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.44,1:06:19.82,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.70,1:06:24.03,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Pulse confirmed!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.03,1:06:25.41,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Force expel the plug!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.12,1:06:29.33,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,LCL drain in progress.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.33,1:06:30.87,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Begin emergency LCL draining!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.87,1:06:31.29,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.08,1:06:33.88,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Draining LCL.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.88,1:06:35.05,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Treat him, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.58,1:07:16.54,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The target is currently invading from above.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.54,1:07:18.92,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It is burrowing into the GeoFront.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.92,1:07:22.88,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's aiming to attack Nerve Headquarters directly?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.88,1:07:26.05,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, every department report in.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.81,1:07:28.39,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Judging from the previous battle
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.39,1:07:32.94,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,the target seems to automatically fire on any foreign object within its space.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.94,1:07:36.27,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Then Eva won't be able to attack it directly...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.27,1:07:37.48,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,How is its AT Field?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.48,1:07:38.90,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Active.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.90,1:07:43.32,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,To make matters worse, it has the ability to change phase space for external protection.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.32,1:07:45.37,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Neutralizing it will be very difficult.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.37,1:07:52.66,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The MAGI estimate that N² Mines might pass through its AT Field,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.66,1:07:56.42,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,but cause unnecessary damage to Nerve Headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.42,1:07:59.50,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,MAGI-2 in Matsushiro has reached the same conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.04,1:08:05.80,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Presently, the Japanese Government and U.N. forces have proposed bombing Nerve Headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.80,1:08:08.60,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,They sure say some outrageous stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.60,1:08:11.43,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,If we lose here, it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.43,1:08:15.94,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Still, it's passed through the second armored layer.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.94,1:08:18.56,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's already begun penetrating the third.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.56,1:08:22.73,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,From today, it will have to pass through 22 layers total.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.73,1:08:28.28,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It is expected to reach Headquarters tomorrow morning at 0 hours 06 minutes and 54 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.28,1:08:30.58,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That's 10 hours 14 minutes from now.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.58,1:08:33.95,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,To make matters worse, Unit-00 is still not battle ready...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.95,1:08:37.88,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Unit-01 is also currently unmovable due to its previous injury.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.08,1:08:41.50,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't a very good situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.50,1:08:44.09,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We're basically completely doomed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.09,1:08:46.63,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ready to wave the white flag?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.63,1:08:48.26,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Not a bad idea...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.26,1:08:51.72,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,but before that, I think we should try something out.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.01,1:08:55.89,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What about the emergency battle plan from the secret agency?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.70,1:09:12.16,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.16,1:09:16.41,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,you've drafted quite an insane plan, Operations Chief Katsuragi.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.41,1:09:18.62,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be rude.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.62,1:09:22.84,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It takes 9 hours to implement, and it's the plan with the highest probability of success.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.84,1:09:24.55,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Operation Yashima...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.55,1:09:29.05,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It will require the electric power of the entire nation.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.05,1:09:31.76,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You even got your hands on JSSDF's secret
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.76,1:09:35.48,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,prototype high-output positron rifle.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.43,1:09:38.73,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's incomplete
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.73,1:09:43.66,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,so it's been modified for the Eva to snipe with.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.44,1:09:50.28,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The U.N. is fine with it, though the Ministry of Home Affairs and JSSDF required some persuasion.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.78,1:09:54.07,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, they owe me a few favors.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.16,1:09:59.12,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Set a thief to catch a thief, I guess...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.66,1:10:06.63,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,As of midnight tonight, the entire country will suffer a large-scale blackout.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.63,1:10:09.76,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We ask for everyone's cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.76,1:10:10.93,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I repeat:
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.93,1:10:17.28,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,As of midnight tonight, the entire country will suffer a large-scale blackout.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.28,1:10:20.27,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We ask for everyone's cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.56,1:10:19.77,Overlap,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.77,1:10:20.27,Overlap,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.27,1:10:21.67,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I repeat:
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.67,1:10:27.28,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,As of midnight tonight, the entire country will suffer a large-scale blackout.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.28,1:10:30.24,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We ask for everyone's cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.96,1:10:54.30,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The enemy has penetrated through the 7th armored plate!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.30,1:10:56.01,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What is the status of the energy system?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.01,1:11:00.97,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Electric lines will pass through transformer substations directly to Chamber 2.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.97,1:11:05.86,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Superconductivity Cable connecting to Mt. Futago is being constructed.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.86,1:11:11.45,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,All voltage systems are set to direct there at 22 hours 50 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.45,1:11:13.36,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What about the sniping system?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.36,1:11:15.45,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No problems with assembly so far.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.45,1:11:17.54,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll be ready somehow.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.54,1:11:19.20,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What is Unit-01's status?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.20,1:11:22.54,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It is currently being fitted with the G-Mold sniping equipment.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.54,1:11:24.71,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It will be ready in another 2 hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.71,1:11:25.83,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.83,1:11:27.75,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Now the only issue is the pilot.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.75,1:11:31.34,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder... will he be willing to pilot it again?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.22,1:11:37.39,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What is the condition of Unit-01's pilot?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.39,1:11:41.26,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's too soon to test the Dummy Plug.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.26,1:11:45.31,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make full use of the current pilot until it's complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.31,1:11:47.69,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Will you brainwash him if he denies?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.69,1:11:50.65,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,If he's unusable, we can simply use Rei.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.65,1:11:52.28,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Rei in Unit-01?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.94,1:11:54.99,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That's much too risky.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.61,1:12:01.16,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We must use any means to destroy the last 8 Angels.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.62,1:12:04.87,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That's when it will all begin.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.75,1:12:16.26,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I hate piloting Eva.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.72,1:12:21.64,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's no surprise that I do well, so no one praises me for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.64,1:12:23.85,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,If I fail, everyone will hate me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.85,1:12:25.23,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Even worse, I could die.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.18,1:12:27.98,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Why am I here?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.27,1:12:35.24,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I came here because I thought maybe something could change... something good could happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.24,1:12:37.49,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Not to live my life in pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.49,1:12:41.70,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Will you keep living by running away from what you can't take?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.79,1:12:44.33,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Living?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.16,1:12:46.75,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Why am I alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.71,1:12:50.34,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I was thinking that there was no point in living.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.88,1:12:55.76,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Neither Father nor Misato-san... no one wants me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.76,1:12:58.34,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Nobody needs me if I don't pilot the Eva.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.47,1:13:01.97,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I have to pilot it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.93,1:13:05.27,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I can be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.02,1:13:08.77,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,But, when I pilot the Eva...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.90,1:13:14.99,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The same ceiling as before.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.65,1:13:19.07,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,When I pilot Eva, this is all I get.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.16,1:13:24.50,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.24,1:13:27.50,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You've been here the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.66,1:13:35.17,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We are scheduled to begin Operation Yashima at 0000 hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.17,1:13:41.30,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Pilots Ikari and Ayanami are to report to Cage 2 at 1930 hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.30,1:13:46.43,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,At 2000 hours, Unit-01, and Unit-00 in a support role, will transfer.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.43,1:13:48.64,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,At 2005 hours, we will launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.64,1:13:51.73,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,At 2030, we will arrive at Barricade 2 on Mt. Futago.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.73,1:13:54.98,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We will await further instructions there.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.98,1:13:59.19,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The mission begins at midnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.36,1:14:01.20,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Food.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.07,1:14:05.04,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm... not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.04,1:14:07.49,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We will leave in 90 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.08,1:14:10.72,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll... have to pilot it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.72,1:14:11.66,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.66,1:14:13.58,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.58,1:14:15.98,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to have those scary thoughts again.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.98,1:14:20.42,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Too frightening... And I can't run away this time...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.42,1:14:22.22,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You're afraid of Eva?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.09,1:14:24.89,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Then stay and rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.01,1:14:27.39,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Rest?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.39,1:14:29.97,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I will pilot Unit-01.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.56,1:14:33.27,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.31,1:14:35.48,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.83,1:14:54.21,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The enemy is penetrating through the 17th armored plate!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.21,1:14:57.21,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Target will reach Nerve Headquarters in 4 hours 55 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.21,1:15:01.72,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The new western Hakone line and the southern Tatsunosawa overhead line have been completed.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.72,1:15:06.18,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The Number 16 BANK is currently establishing its transformer equipment.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.18,1:15:09.89,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The 500,000 volt flow from the transformer is as calculated.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.89,1:15:11.48,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No alterations made.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.48,1:15:15.14,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The 28th unit of transformers will arrive in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.14,1:15:18.40,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,All personnel, please hasten your operations.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.40,1:15:21.00,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Initiating stage four of battle simulation.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.00,1:15:23.78,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Reconfirming the recovery and support systems.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.78,1:15:26.72,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,SMES setup for all units complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.72,1:15:30.25,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Initiate operational confirmation from the first unit.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.25,1:15:34.64,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Operational check for all mega-high voltage superconductor transformers complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.64,1:15:35.58,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.34,1:15:46.85,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That giant thing is the Positron Gun?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.85,1:15:48.55,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Even though it's still being constructed
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.55,1:15:50.89,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,there are no problems with the overall theory.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.89,1:15:55.06,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We will forcibly link the alignment with the G-Mold Equipment.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.06,1:15:55.77,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.77,1:15:57.56,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I hope it does its job.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.56,1:16:00.07,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The pilot's the actual problem...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.81,1:16:03.28,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That's up to you, Misato.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.66,1:16:11.87,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun, you're late for the rendezvous time.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.50,1:16:18.00,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You made the decision to stay here, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.54,1:16:21.13,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Do your part in this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.75,1:16:25.92,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm afraid... to pilot Eva.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.55,1:16:28.64,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You and the others don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.18,1:16:32.89,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Always giving orders from underground, where it's safe...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.89,1:16:35.18,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Only I have to experience that fear...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.60,1:16:37.69,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You're all unfair!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.90,1:16:47.45,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.99,1:16:56.04,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,15 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.12,1:17:00.75,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,the Second Impact eliminated half of humanity.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.46,1:17:04.42,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,If the Angels are to accomplish the Third Impact,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.42,1:17:06.13,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,humanity would surely perish.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.13,1:17:07.67,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Not one will remain.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.42,1:17:10.89,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I've heard all this before...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.72,1:17:19.94,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,If an Angel ever reaches Level-EEE of Nerve Headquarters...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.98,1:17:24.06,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,an Automatic Self-Destruct would commence.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.32,1:17:29.65,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It is a necessary precaution against the Angels, and the Third Impact.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.40,1:17:34.62,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone here shares that resolve.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.85,1:17:53.89,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.31,1:17:57.02,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It can't be...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.22,1:17:58.89,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Eva?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.89,1:18:00.85,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.85,1:18:03.35,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,This is the start of all life on this planet,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.35,1:18:08.61,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,and the key to the end, the Second Angel, Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.61,1:18:09.85,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Lilith...?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.85,1:18:13.74,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, the trigger of the Third Impact.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.70,1:18:18.49,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,To protect Lilith, Eva must fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.49,1:18:20.71,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Only you can pilot the Eva.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.16,1:18:25.63,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We have entrusted the future of humanity to Eva, and to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.38,1:18:30.05,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,To do something so painful... why me?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.51,1:18:32.22,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No particular reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.22,1:18:34.80,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's simply your fate.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.47,1:18:40.43,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,But you're not the only one fighting with your life on the line, Shinji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.08,1:18:42.48,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We all are.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.36,1:18:48.98,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,One more time.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.98,1:18:50.20,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.67,1:19:08.50,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Now then, I'll explain the arrangements for this operation.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.50,1:19:09.59,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.59,1:19:10.38,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.38,1:19:12.55,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You will be gunning from Unit-01.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.55,1:19:13.55,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.55,1:19:15.97,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Rei will defend you from Unit-00.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.97,1:19:17.26,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.26,1:19:21.10,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,This mission will require precise, accurate operations.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.10,1:19:27.64,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,For that reason, Unit-01 is more suited than the still unrepaired Unit-00.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.02,1:19:29.48,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, Shinji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.48,1:19:32.34,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The positron beam is influenced by the Earth's rotation and local gravity
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.34,1:19:35.55,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,so it will not fire in a straight line.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.55,1:19:38.12,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't forget to adjust for that error.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.57,1:19:41.46,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You must strike a single point of the core.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.46,1:19:44.17,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,But we don't know where the core is!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.17,1:19:45.71,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.71,1:19:49.55,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,When the target is in attack form, something materializes within it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.17,1:19:52.63,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We assume it is the core.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.63,1:19:58.18,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Locating the sniping position, along with other various shooting factors, will be handled by us.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.18,1:20:00.11,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You just follow the manual.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.11,1:20:04.43,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,When the markers line up in the center, fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.43,1:20:06.36,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The computer takes care of the rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.31,1:20:13.99,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,However, this operation will require a focused point of fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.99,1:20:17.70,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Unit-01 will not be able to move from its firing position.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.24,1:20:20.41,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no retreating this time...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.41,1:20:21.37,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.37,1:20:24.49,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What if I miss and the enemy returns fire?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.49,1:20:26.88,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't think about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.88,1:20:29.63,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Focus on destroying the target in one shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.21,1:20:33.17,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Else I'm screwed, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.17,1:20:34.26,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.96,1:20:37.15,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I am to protect Unit-01?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.15,1:20:37.72,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.18,1:20:39.05,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.72,1:20:40.77,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.77,1:20:42.51,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You two go change.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.51,1:20:43.14,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.90,1:20:53.24,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I think...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.65,1:20:56.94,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I think...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.94,1:20:58.41,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,we might die this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.66,1:21:01.45,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.87,1:21:04.91,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You won't die.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.54,1:21:07.08,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I will protect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.13,1:21:15.88,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not much to protect.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.76,1:21:19.34,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,These messages were forwarded from the PR of Headquarters to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.47,1:21:29.94,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, this is Suzuhara.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.60,1:21:32.27,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ikari, no{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.27,1:21:34.44,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I should call you Shinji...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.44,1:21:36.40,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji, do us proud.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.32,1:21:40.36,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, this is Aida.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.36,1:21:40.99,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ikari,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.57,1:21:42.95,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.45,1:22:30.25,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami, why do you pilot Eva?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.62,1:22:33.79,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It is my bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.46,1:22:36.21,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Your bond?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.21,1:22:37.50,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.50,1:22:38.51,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,My bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.17,1:22:41.59,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,With my father?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.42,1:22:43.63,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,With everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.76,1:22:47.35,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You're strong, Ayanami.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.97,1:22:51.48,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have anything else.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.06,1:22:54.66,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.66,1:22:55.61,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.28,1:23:00.15,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.58,1:23:13.29,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It is currently 0000 hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.29,1:23:14.42,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That is all.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.21,1:23:19.67,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.67,1:23:20.51,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.09,1:23:22.96,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,you've chosen to pilot Eva.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.96,1:23:25.14,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm grateful for that alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.14,1:23:26.72,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.72,1:23:28.64,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Begin Operation Yashima.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.64,1:23:30.35,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Prepare Positron Rifle charge.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.35,1:23:32.06,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Initiate first connection.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.06,1:23:32.81,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.81,1:23:36.19,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Transferring power from water exchange unit.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.19,1:23:38.44,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,All cooling systems at full power.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.57,1:23:42.05,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,All transformers, maintain full operation.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.05,1:23:44.07,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,0.7 seconds remaining until maximum output.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.07,1:23:46.11,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No problems found in power supply system.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.11,1:23:49.37,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Transformer frequency capacity: 65 gigawatts and rising.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.37,1:23:51.24,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,All inverters still in operation.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.24,1:23:53.87,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,In the process of first stage partitioning.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.87,1:23:56.95,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Opening blocks 1 through 803 circuit.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.95,1:23:58.28,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Voltage stable.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.28,1:24:00.42,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Maintaining system frequency of 50 Hz.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.42,1:24:02.09,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Initiate second connection.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.30,1:24:05.91,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Starting all accelerators. Starting converger.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.62,1:24:07.41,Chatter,,0000,0000,0000,,Begin transfer from the new Susouno transformer.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.63,1:24:09.39,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Transferring power from Mt. Gotemba sub-station.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.39,1:24:11.34,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No issues with the breadth of the energy fluctuations.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.35,1:24:12.97,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Initiate third connection.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.97,1:24:13.67,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.67,1:24:16.15,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Beginning connection. Transferring all energy to Mt. Futago substation.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.15,1:24:18.86,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Maintain maximum voltage for electricity transmission streams.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.86,1:24:22.57,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,All connections running at maximum.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.35,1:24:24.97,Chatter,,0000,0000,0000,,78.6% of the superconductor energy storage is charged.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.12,1:24:27.19,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Begin flywheel rotation.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.03,1:24:29.37,Chatter,,0000,0000,0000,,Maintaining maximum energy conversion from western Japan.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.37,1:24:31.58,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No problems detected with third connection.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.58,1:24:32.70,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.70,1:24:34.54,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Transmit to barricades 4 and 5.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.54,1:24:36.54,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll be acting according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.54,1:24:38.71,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,After observing its reaction, take immediate action.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.03,1:25:10.24,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Defense systems 1 and 3 destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.24,1:25:12.20,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I see... nothing can pass within its space.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.20,1:25:12.79,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Next!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.92,1:25:26.08,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Barricade 2 has been hit!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.08,1:25:28.01,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,VLS-08 has been vaporized!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.01,1:25:30.19,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Commence fourth attack from land.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.88,1:25:33.90,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Missile trench six, destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.13,1:25:37.53,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Laser artillery three, open fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.81,1:25:40.19,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Follow up with artillery seven.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.19,1:25:43.14,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Energy accumulating by positron accelerator, plus one tera.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.14,1:25:45.81,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Final rotation speed maintained at 38,000.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.81,1:25:48.11,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Increasing to the compression density discharge point.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.11,1:25:49.76,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Rapid loss in power!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.14,1:25:51.99,Chatter,,0000,0000,0000,,Voltage conversion rate is approaching 0.019%.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.99,1:25:54.13,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Cut off the affected circuits!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.97,1:25:54.19,Chatter,,0000,0000,0000,,Switch over!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.13,1:25:56.07,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The energy decrease is within acceptable bounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.07,1:25:58.00,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,System circuits are operational.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.00,1:25:58.96,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Initiating system recovery.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.96,1:26:00.20,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Fourth connection complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.20,1:26:01.08,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No problems detected.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.08,1:26:02.92,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The final defense systems have been destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.92,1:26:03.96,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Pull back the sear!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.93,1:26:12.51,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Launcher Scope attached.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.51,1:26:17.39,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Adjust for the gravity field and revolution of the Earth by positive 0.0009.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.39,1:26:19.85,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Firing mechanism is automatically locking on.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.31,1:26:22.27,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Positron preparations complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.27,1:26:26.57,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The photons are accelerating. 0.2 to discharge... 0.1{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.57,1:26:28.49,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Initiate fifth and final connection!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.57,1:26:32.44,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Transferring all energy to super-high voltage discharge system.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.44,1:26:35.20,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Discharge plugs 1 through 9 are ready to accept power.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.20,1:26:37.26,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Final corrections made to the photon acceleration tube.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.26,1:26:38.12,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Pulse is safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.12,1:26:38.91,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No problems detected.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.91,1:26:41.21,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have the same resolve as Ayanami...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.87,1:26:44.71,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,And I don't have the confidence to handle Eva.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.46,1:26:48.17,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,All I can do is instinctively move it for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.88,1:26:50.51,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Protecting humanity?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.30,1:26:54.09,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't even have a sense of its importance...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.72,1:26:56.51,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Why me?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.10,1:27:02.15,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,13, 12, 11, 10...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.15,1:27:06.15,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,9, 8, 7, 6...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.15,1:27:11.20,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,5, 4, 3, 2, 1.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.28,1:27:11.86,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.30,1:27:33.22,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Did we get it?!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.10,1:27:40.89,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We missed?!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.89,1:27:41.56,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.56,1:27:42.44,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Terrible timing...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.39,1:27:45.23,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,High energy reaction detected in the target!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.23,1:27:46.94,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,All hands, brace for impact!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.68,1:28:22.31,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the status of the Energy System?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.31,1:28:23.47,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Operational.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.47,1:28:25.68,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's already begun to recharge.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.68,1:28:27.10,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The Positron Gun?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.10,1:28:28.27,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.27,1:28:30.06,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The gun barrel is now cooling.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.06,1:28:32.65,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,But we don't know if it can manage another shot!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.65,1:28:35.22,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't matter. We'll do it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.22,1:28:36.53,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun, are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.45,1:28:40.53,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Quickly, get Unit-01 back to firing position!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.70,1:28:43.50,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun?!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.88,1:28:56.59,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,If Unit-01's pilot is unable to take the shot, exchange places!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.59,1:28:59.80,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll entrust the task of sniping to Unit-00's pilot.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.80,1:29:01.34,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ikari!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.34,1:29:04.22,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,If we're unable to use him, we have no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.22,1:29:05.73,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.22,1:29:08.31,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,He chose to pilot Eva without running away.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.06,1:29:11.10,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Unless he chooses to fall back,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.10,1:29:12.77,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I entrust this to him!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.19,1:29:15.29,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.29,1:29:16.36,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,do us proud!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.36,1:29:17.26,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ikari,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.26,1:29:18.28,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.38,1:29:37.93,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Please believe in your son!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.39,1:29:48.06,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I also believe in Unit-01's pilot!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.48,1:29:52.69,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll leave it to you then.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.69,1:29:53.94,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Do as you please.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.94,1:29:55.23,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.32,1:29:57.48,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.48,1:29:58.74,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.74,1:30:01.70,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,All of Japan's energy is with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.70,1:30:04.08,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,All of our hopes,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.08,1:30:08.04,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,the future of humanity, and every living creature
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.58,1:30:10.17,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,has been entrusted to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.17,1:30:11.79,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.46,1:30:13.13,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.76,1:30:17.03,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Gun barrel in position!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.03,1:30:18.47,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Discharge system has been re-adjusted!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.47,1:30:20.47,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Unit-01's G-Mold Equipment has been discarded!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.47,1:30:23.89,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Final firing system switched to manual!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.15,1:30:32.78,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The enemy has reached the Headquarters!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.78,1:30:33.64,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,It has breached the zero point!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.65,1:30:34.98,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Quickly ready the second shot!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.82,1:30:39.32,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Gun barrel fuse cooling complete!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.32,1:30:41.91,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Maintain full power output.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.91,1:30:44.37,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Evacuation of personnel complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.37,1:30:46.32,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,No problems with any of the discharge plugs.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.32,1:30:47.38,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Firing coordinates complete!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.38,1:30:48.72,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Calculations corrected!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.72,1:30:50.00,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Minor adjustments
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.00,1:30:51.91,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,are in the pilot's control.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.91,1:30:54.33,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Reaching discharge pressure in 0.2.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.63,1:30:57.67,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Another high energy reading from the target!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.67,1:30:58.51,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.10,1:31:07.93,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Shinji-kun!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.24,1:31:21.24,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.66,1:31:27.62,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The shield is breaking up!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.62,1:31:28.41,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,How much longer?!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.29,1:31:31.83,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.41,1:31:29.45,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,20 seconds!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.00,1:31:41.10,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on... come on...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.88,1:31:44.89,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.79,1:32:17.75,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.28,1:32:49.66,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.12,1:32:55.66,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.11,1:33:29.87,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.87,1:33:31.61,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay, Ayanami?!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.61,1:33:32.33,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ayanami!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.25,1:33:47.55,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't say "I don't have anything else."
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.33,1:33:54.51,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't say "goodbye" before a mission... it's too sad...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.23,1:34:04.98,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.98,1:34:06.03,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You're crying.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.07,1:34:14.33,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, but I don't know what expression to have at times like these.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.49,1:34:17.70,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I think you should smile.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.36,1:34:57.20,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.49,1:34:59.74,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That boy has awakened,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.74,1:35:02.04,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,and has entered the generalization stage.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.70,1:35:03.91,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.91,1:35:07.75,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,We will move in accordance with the law written in the Dead Sea Scroll.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.75,1:35:10.63,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The time to fulfill the contract is near.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.38,1:35:16.59,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The third again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.59,1:35:18.52,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,You never change, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.68,1:35:23.60,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,I look foward to meeting you, Ikari Shinji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.40,1:40:29.49,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The launch of provisional Eva Unit-05.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.49,1:40:31.74,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The adoption of Eva Unit-02 and its pilot.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.16,1:40:33.75,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The disappearance of Eva Unit-04.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.96,1:40:36.50,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,The forced activation testing of Eva Unit-03.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.71,1:40:40.25,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,And then, Eva Unit-06 and its pilot descend from the Moon.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.17,1:40:46.01,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,How long will Ikari Shinji's steadily deteriorating tale continue?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.63,1:40:49.14,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Next time, Rebuild of Evangelion 2.0: Division.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.14,1:40:53.94,M2,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, and there'll be plenty of fan service!
