Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.01,1:35:37.38,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}It's only love
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.38,1:35:41.22,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}It's only love
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.99,1:35:51.31,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}If I can be granted just one wish,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.38,1:35:59.82,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}please let me sleep next to you. Any place is fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.82,1:36:02.85,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}Beautiful world
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.85,1:36:08.16,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}Without regrets, my eyes are only on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.16,1:36:10.87,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}Beautiful boy
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.15,1:36:18.46,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}You don't even know how beautiful you are
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.99,1:36:22.22,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}It's only love
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.74,1:36:30.77,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}Whether you're sleeping or awake,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.77,1:36:40.82,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}you just dream of shounen manga, silly. Don't you like yourself?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.39,1:36:47.54,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}You don't know what you want, but you can't stop wanting.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.54,1:36:58.13,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}Lukewarm tears roll down your cheeks.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.15,1:37:00.30,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}I have nothing I want to tell you,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.30,1:37:04.14,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}I just want to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.45,1:37:08.35,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}I can't say what I want to tell you,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.50,1:37:12.73,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}maybe I'm just a coward.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.96,1:37:14.90,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}But that's all right too.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.92,1:37:23.11,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}If I can be granted just one wish,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.34,1:37:31.50,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}please let me sleep next to you. Any place is fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.60,1:37:34.62,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}Beautiful world
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.62,1:37:39.96,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}Without regrets, my eyes are only on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.99,1:37:43.01,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}Beautiful boy
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.03,1:37:50.39,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}You don't even know how beautiful you are
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.91,1:37:54.60,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}It's only love
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.50,1:38:02.65,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}No matter what it is, give everything a try.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.65,1:38:13.12,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}Even if you get hurt, it's a valuable experience.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.27,1:38:15.46,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}I don't need newpapers.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.52,1:38:18.58,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}The important things are not printed there.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.61,1:38:23.76,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}How are you doing recently?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.82,1:38:26.51,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}If you are fine, then
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.16,1:38:29.97,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}that's good I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.04,1:38:38.35,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}If I can't meet you before my world ends,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.35,1:38:46.82,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}please let me sleep next to you. Any place will do.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.82,1:38:49.78,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}Beautiful world
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.85,1:38:55.16,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}As these fleeting days pass by,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.16,1:38:58.04,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}Beautiful boy
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.19,1:39:03.21,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}it's natural to feel whimsical.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.44,1:39:11.80,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}If I can be granted just one wish,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.80,1:39:18.39,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}please let me sleep next to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.81,1:39:39.96,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}Beautiful world
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.11,1:39:48.17,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}Beautiful boy
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.45,1:39:56.60,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}Beautiful world
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.79,1:40:04.86,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}Beautiful boy
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.14,1:40:13.37,Translation,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}Beautiful world
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.99,1:35:51.31,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}もしも願い一つだけ叶うなら
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.38,1:35:59.82,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}君の側で眠らせて　どんな場所でもいいよ
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.85,1:36:08.16,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}迷わず君だけを見つめている
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.15,1:36:18.46,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}自分の美しさ　まだ知らないの
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.74,1:36:30.77,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}寝ても覚めても少年マンガ
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.77,1:36:40.82,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}夢見てばっか　自分が好きじゃないの
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.39,1:36:47.54,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}何が欲しいか分からなくて
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.54,1:36:58.13,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}ただ欲しがって　ぬるい涙が頬を伝う
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.15,1:37:00.30,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}言いたいことなんか無い
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.30,1:37:04.14,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}ただもう一度会いたい
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.45,1:37:08.35,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}言いたいこと言えない
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.50,1:37:12.73,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}根性無しかもしれない
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.96,1:37:14.90,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}それでいいけど
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.92,1:37:23.11,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}もしも願い一つだけ叶うなら
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.34,1:37:31.50,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}君の側で眠らせて　どんな場所でもいいよ
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.62,1:37:39.96,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}迷わず君だけを見つめている
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.03,1:37:50.39,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}自分の美しさ　まだ知らないの
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.50,1:38:02.65,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}どんなことでもやってみて
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.65,1:38:13.12,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}損をしたって　少し経験値上がる
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.27,1:38:15.46,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}新聞なんかいらない
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.52,1:38:18.58,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}肝心なこと載ってない
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.61,1:38:23.76,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}最近調子どうだい？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.82,1:38:26.51,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}元気にしてるなら
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.16,1:38:29.97,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}別にいいけど
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.04,1:38:38.35,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}僕の世界消えるまで会えぬなら
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.35,1:38:46.82,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}君の側で眠らせて　どんな場所でも結構\
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.85,1:38:55.16,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}儚く過ぎて行く日々の中で
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.19,1:39:03.21,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}気分のムラは仕方ないね
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.44,1:39:11.80,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}もしも願い一つだけ叶うなら
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.80,1:39:18.39,Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,300)}君の側で眠らせて
